{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16103480","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16103480","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1610348001:1":{"text":"Hello, excuse me, have you ever seen this thing before?","source_cn":"女士，请问，你有没有见过这个？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2A068B09896FDBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610348002:1":{"text":"They're found in the water. If you've seen them, please tell us.","source_cn":"它们在水里出没，如果你见过，请一定要告诉我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89B310932C6B6452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610348003:1":{"text":"Oh, the shiny little things that swim with the wind? Yes, yes! Disgusting taste. Wouldn't recommend.","source_cn":"啾啾！是那些可以把风当水游，并且一点也不好吃的家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8F9B2DF790D9A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1610348003":{"text":"Oh, the shiny little things that swim with the wind? Yes, yes! Disgusting taste. Wouldn't recommend.","source_cn":"啾啾！是那些可以把风当水游，并且一点也不好吃的家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8F9B2DF790D9A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610348004:1":{"text":"Yes, I've seen them.","source_cn":"啾见过。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x42612DF083F2A7E8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes, I've seen them.","female":"Yes, I've seen them.","variant_male_record_index":"203545","variant_female_record_index":"203546","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1610348004":{"text":"Yes, I've seen them.","source_cn":"啾见过。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x42612DF083F2A7E8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes, I've seen them.","female":"Yes, I've seen them.","variant_male_record_index":"203545","variant_female_record_index":"203546","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610348005:1":{"text":"Hmm... let's not rush into details. First, take a moment to appreciate me. How magnificent are my wings today?","source_cn":"先别说这个啾，先夸夸啾刚刚打理好的羽毛漂亮不漂亮！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDB042521B8371552","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hmm... let's not rush into details. First, take a moment to appreciate me. How magnificent are my wings today?","female":"Hmm... let's not rush into details. First, take a moment to appreciate me. How magnificent are my wings today?","variant_male_record_index":"203547","variant_female_record_index":"203548","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610348006:1":{"text":"Umm... They look so pretty! So sleek and glossy!","source_cn":"呃……特别好看！像打了蜡一样光滑呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AE2016F47009FEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1610348007:1":{"text":"Go on.","source_cn":"还有呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5928BF38B2962538","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Go on.","female":"Go on.","variant_male_record_index":"203550","variant_female_record_index":"203551","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1610348008:1":{"text":"Uh... They're more beautiful than the rainbow in the sky!","source_cn":"比……比天上的彩虹还好看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38987228CB9A446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610348009:1":{"text":"Go on.","source_cn":"还有呢还有呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC6978B9F60A2512","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Go on.","female":"Go on.","variant_male_record_index":"203553","variant_female_record_index":"203554","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1610348009":{"text":"Go on.","source_cn":"还有呢还有呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC6978B9F60A2512","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Go on.","female":"Go on.","variant_male_record_index":"203553","variant_female_record_index":"203554","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1610348010:1":{"text":"Angry featherless things... Ah! Don't tug on my feathers! I'll tell you!","source_cn":"啾、啾啾……是脾气暴躁的人类……不要打啾！啾说……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAD76C79C5D700D5E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Angry featherless things... Ah! Don't tug on my feathers! I'll tell you!","female":"Angry featherless things... Ah! Don't tug on my feathers! I'll tell you!","variant_male_record_index":"203555","variant_female_record_index":"203556","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610348013:1":{"text":"I've seen them on the side of the island with the most water plants!","source_cn":"啾在这座岛屿水草最丰美的那一边见过！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0F0A2EFE870CF034","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I've seen them on the side of the island with the most water plants!","female":"I've seen them on the side of the island with the most water plants!","variant_male_record_index":"203561","variant_female_record_index":"203562","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1610348014:1":{"text":"Aquatic plants! Got it! So it's back to the scene of the crime... I mean, my earlier impromptu swim.","source_cn":"水草丰美……唔，我落水的地方水草倒是很丰美。看来还是得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8CF9F326E27AFDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1610348015:1":{"text":"Thanks for your help, you dazzling feathered diva.","source_cn":"啾啾女士，谢谢你的帮助！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE76043F687303CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1610348016:1":{"text":"You're welcome, humble peasant.","source_cn":"不客气啾！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30266293268CB6DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"This bird is annoying!","source_cn":"你这鸟好烦啊！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x003C5ABB71725CDA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"This bird is annoying!","female":"This bird is annoying!","variant_male_record_index":"83019","variant_female_record_index":"83020","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1610348011:1":{"text":"NO! Wait! Do not abandon me! Okay, okay, I'll tell you.","source_cn":"别走！啾告诉你们就是了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7343C763DE9B1D0D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"NO! Wait! Do not abandon me! Okay, okay, I'll tell you.","female":"NO! Wait! Do not abandon me! Okay, okay, I'll tell you.","variant_male_record_index":"203557","variant_female_record_index":"203558","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"Pippa, let's go ask the other birds.","source_cn":"皮帕，我们去问别的鸟","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C43083AA57031BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Pippa, let's go ask the other birds.","female":"Pippa, let's go ask the other birds.","variant_male_record_index":"83021","variant_female_record_index":"83022","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1610348012:1":{"text":"*Gasp*... You truly understand art. Fine, I'll tell you.","source_cn":"啾啾啾！啾很满意！啾告诉你们！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5276E84B8AA1945F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"*Gasp*... You truly understand art. Fine, I'll tell you.","female":"*Gasp*... You truly understand art. Fine, I'll tell you.","variant_male_record_index":"203559","variant_female_record_index":"203560","document_